    },
    "body": "The recorded temporal-credit displacement self_transition[3610] q−1→−2 does not change the final U transition on any of nine saved query-plus-prefix predecessors. On the failing row class62 gains2,097,152Q24 but trails the winner by13,879,024; winner49 is unchanged. This closes the separate saved U predecessor question without a blind fit.\n\nAdds an offline Rust U margin mode to the existing native score helper. It authenticates exact query IDs/counts, prefix ancestry, prior actual chosen token, old/new U states and Context metadata, and checks native baseline right-H4 composition against the persisted next state. The original Prefix mode retains its numerical computation and output. No serving branch, rerank, backward, encoder advance, export or model replay is added. Earlier query/prefix effects remain unmeasured.\n\nExecuted source db5a67aa1 passed4focused Rust tests in each tool, scoped formatting and CUDA-feature release build. Saved arithmetic17.862431s; independent reader22d1deb5 audited all9packed native score rows, ties/effects, state composition and counts; all4complete-file Rust verifications pass. Source/math/adversarial review PASS. Complete source, executable, result and audit privately preserved at619d45f4a0d623fc58b712c6449c94006129f862 and freshly downloaded/hash verified. Exact final-head4tests in each tool, format/release build and source/docs review PASS; actual validation receipt posted before queueing.\n\nNext is one complete consumed-path question for the same coordinate. Recover and reuse matching retained complete control traces, capture missing paths with the existing native guard, and settle earlier transition effects before a finite candidate. Local margins establish no fullpool/objective/reply gain; previous8/512 remains in its original scope. References #820.\n",
